    "attacksNotes": "<p>Scorch [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 5 + Melee Combat 1), Reach: 5 ft.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 2 damage (1 + 1 Str) + 2 fire damage (Half DR)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 2 damage, DR halved (round up) + 2 fire damage; target gains the Singed condition.</li>\n</ul>",
